## 权限模型

定义四类权限维度，每个工具声明所需的权限集合：

```typescript
type Permission = 'file:read' | 'file:write' | 'net:fetch' | 'net:search' | 'exec:run' | 'db:query' | 'db:write';

interface ToolPermissions {
  toolName: string;
  required: Permission[];
}

interface SandboxPolicy {
  allowed: Permission[];
  deniedPaths: string[];
  allowedHosts: string[];
  maxExecutionMs: number;
  maxOutputBytes: number;
}
```

权限矩阵：

| 工具         | 所需权限     | 默认策略      |
| ------------ | ------------ | ------------- |
| `readFile`   | `file:read`  | ✅ 允许       |
| `writeFile`  | `file:write` | ⚠️ 受限路径   |
| `httpFetch`  | `net:fetch`  | ⚠️ 白名单域名 |
| `webSearch`  | `net:search` | ✅ 允许       |
| `sqlQuery`   | `db:query`   | ✅ 只读       |
| `runCommand` | `exec:run`   | ❌ 默认禁止   |

